  "title": "Agree Realty Announces First Quarter 2026 Earnings Release Date and Conference Call Information",
  "summary": "Agree Realty Corporation (NYSE: ADC) (the “Company”) today announced that it will release its first quarter 2026 operating results after the market closes on Tuesday, April 21, 2026. A conference call to discuss the Company’s operating results is scheduled for Wednesday, April 22, 2026, at 9:00 AM ET. Interested parties and shareholders may access the call via teleconference or webcast: Teleconference: USA Toll Free (800) 715-9871 International (646) 307-1963 Conference ID 2741039 Webcast: https",
